</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 1.0 (build 976)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Two mutes.</b> M (or the sound button) mutes the clip's audio; &#8679;M (or the speaker in the notes header) mutes voice-note playback. Listen to the room's notes over a silent shot, or the shot over a quiet room. Each is remembered.</li>
<li><b>Attachments everywhere they should be.</b> The PDF report shows a note's files as tiles under its lines; File &#8250; Export &#8250; <b>Export Attachments&#8230;</b> writes every note's files to a folder (images as PNG); a reply can carry files too (the paperclip beside the reply field). On the web page, reviewers attach with the paperclip, a drop or a paste, and open any tile in a viewer with Download.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
